msgstr "Přepnout do režimu na celou obrazovku pokud je to vhodné"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_GrabAllKeysOnFullscreen)
#: config/general.ui:126
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Automatically grab all keys when entering fullscreen mode and release them "
